"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"DcBLYSvOuWcNReolRVr12A","review_id":"L3QN3do3zy4qZoyZWtKEUQ","date":"2018-05-12T01:13:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9570421576499939,"text_excerpt":"Drago's was really close to our hotel and when we arrived in New Orleans was the first place we went to get our raw oyster fix. Walked in and this place was packed with a line waiting to put their name on the waiting list. Of course, I just walked on by the line knowing that bar seating is normally open seating. We found a few seats open by where the oysters are charbroiled and was seated immediately by a waitress controlling this area. You have to try the charbroiled oysters as they are being roasted there about 10 feet from you where you can feel the heat coming from the flames that leap up in the air. These charbroiled oysters are really very rich as they add butter and some spiced bre..."},{"business_id":"DcBLYSvOuWcNReolRVr12A","review_id":"Ci2m9hZhk5jzLMiz0u8r1w","date":"2015-08-16T23:24:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9555574655532837,"text_excerpt":"The char grilled oysters here are as amazing as everybody says they are. BELIEVE THE HYPE! They are beautifully seasoned and have a great smokey taste to them as well. Probably one of the best things I tasted during my visit to the big easy. If you visit Drago's for that alone, consider it money well spent! Aside from the oysters blessed by the pope himself, the rest of the menu is great too. I enjoyed an oyster and duck Alfredo pasta and was thoroughly pleased. Only gripe would be the food did take some time to come out, but the help and attention from the staff was still on point. Great spot!"},{"business_id":"DcBLYSvOuWcNReolRVr12A","review_id":"BSgBailYNf0dxaR0UHpr5Q","date":"2013-06-10T23:49:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9553653001785278,"text_excerpt":"Drago's was referred by a friendly bartender (and another patron) at one of the many bars we visited. We we're looking to try more charbroiled oysters. The people here are fiercely proud of their food, it's genuine. All the locals recommended this place hands down - it didn't disappoint. The chargrilled oysters were DELICIOUS - the crusty bread is a must to soak up the buttery goodness. Service was great and the oysters shined. Damn, I hope I can find chargrilled oysters in Los Angeles."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"DcBLYSvOuWcNReolRVr12A","photo_id":"NXk6ega9odFBiJ_j6jcmjQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/NXk6ega9odFBiJ_j6jcmjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8441779613494873},{"business_id":"DcBLYSvOuWcNReolRVr12A","photo_id":"29FRIHjQ9toTlZZcHVYLLw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/29FRIHjQ9toTlZZcHVYLLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8364449739456177},{"business_id":"DcBLYSvOuWcNReolRVr12A","photo_id":"jihka89bYkFqae8m1Jq0Iw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jihka89bYkFqae8m1Jq0Iw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8322440385818481},{"business_id":"DcBLYSvOuWcNReolRVr12A","photo_id":"9ZvY3gHn43uww_DoXfwQQw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/9ZvY3gHn43uww_DoXfwQQw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8069057464599609},{"business_id":"DcBLYSvOuWcNReolRVr12A","photo_id":"HiCNaZ6KdfsvnD9cDP2tAA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HiCNaZ6KdfsvnD9cDP2tAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8017280101776123}]},"notebook_case":null}
